  "source": "The device-plugin CDI spec of c8s v0.59.1 (C8s #954: CDI_FEATURE_FLAGS=disable-ipc-discoverer, driver root /usr and /etc, firmware_class.path=/usr/lib/firmware). It is nvidia-595.71.05.json as derived offline with the nvcdi library against the extracted c8s v0.33.2 node image root (confidential-inference-internal receipts/cdi/node-image-v0.33.2-driver-595.71.05-toolkit-1.19.1.allowlist.json, commit 43c9dcf, sha256:9841d10b5f5897a9653c3f0d428ab2d12ee6f05db45d0cc57da6704941debd4d) without the nvidia-persistenced socket and with the GSP firmware at /usr/lib/firmware. The 14 mounts equal the spec that the device plugin wrote on both GPU workers of a node image built from the #954 changes (b300-node-3, 2026-10-19).",
